{"id":"313999e0230fc8e3","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-arakelov.md","title":"Arakelov Divisor","display":"df-arakelov — Arakelov Divisor","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-arakelov","aliases":["58-df-arakelov"],"display":"df-arakelov — Arakelov Divisor","depends_on":["[[58-df-divisor]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-arakelov"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-arakelov</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arakelov — Arakelov Divisor"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3befcba3ff8da9d2\" href=\"?note=3befcba3ff8da9d2\" title=\"58-df-divisor\">58-df-divisor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,D,S_\\infty,\\widehat D\\in V\">\\(K,D,S_\\infty,\\widehat D\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_\\infty\">\\(S_\\infty\\)</span> (the supplied set of archimedean places of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Divisor}_K(D)\">\\(\\operatorname{Divisor}_K(D)\\)</span> (finite-prime divisor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3befcba3ff8da9d2\" href=\"?note=3befcba3ff8da9d2\" title=\"58-df-divisor\">58-df-divisor</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:S_\\infty\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(g:S_\\infty\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span> (real archimedean coefficients, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat D=\\langle D,g\\rangle\">\\(\\widehat D=\\langle D,g\\rangle\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ArakelovDivisor}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{ArakelovDivisor}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arakelov} \\vdash \\operatorname{ArakelovDivisor}_S(\\widehat D,K,S_\\infty)\\leftrightarrow\\exists D\\,\\exists g\\;\\left(\\widehat D=\\langle D,g\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{Divisor}_K(D)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,S_\\infty,\\mathbb R)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arakelov} \\vdash \\operatorname{ArakelovDivisor}_S(\\widehat D,K,S_\\infty)\\leftrightarrow\\exists D\\,\\exists g\\;\\left(\\widehat D=\\langle D,g\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{Divisor}_K(D)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,S_\\infty,\\mathbb R)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For the arithmetic curve <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Spec}\\mathcal O_K\">\\(\\operatorname{Spec}\\mathcal O_K\\)</span>, an Arakelov divisor pairs a finite-prime divisor with real coefficients on the supplied archimedean-place set.</li>\n<li>The former displayed degree expression incorrectly added Green functions themselves and omitted the hypotheses needed for an arithmetic-degree formula; degree and intersection constructions require separate atoms.</li>\n<li>Hermitian line bundles provide an equivalent geometric presentation only after the relevant correspondence is stated.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Gillet and Soulé, Arithmetic Intersection Theory</li>\n<li>Liu, Algebraic Geometry and Arithmetic Curves</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-divisor","status":"resolved","id":"3befcba3ff8da9d2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-divisor]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-divisor","status":"resolved","id":"3befcba3ff8da9d2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Divisor}_K(D)$ (finite-prime divisor, see [[58-df-divisor]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$g:S_\\infty\\to\\mathbb R$ (real archimedean coefficients, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K,D,S_\\infty,\\widehat D\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"S_\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Divisor}_K(D)","display":false},{"tex":"g:S_\\infty\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat D=\\langle D,g\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ArakelovDivisor}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arakelov} \\vdash \\operatorname{ArakelovDivisor}_S(\\widehat D,K,S_\\infty)\\leftrightarrow\\exists D\\,\\exists g\\;\\left(\\widehat D=\\langle D,g\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{Divisor}_K(D)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,S_\\infty,\\mathbb R)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Spec}\\mathcal O_K","display":false}],"bytes":1529,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-139","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-arakelov.md|58-df-arakelov]]（batch15）"}]